inet.0: 4 destinations, 4 routes (4 active, 0 holddown, 0 hidden)
+ = Active Route, - = Last Active, * = Both

10.0.0.0/24        *[Static/5] 00:10:12
                    > to 192.168.1.1 via ge-0/0/0.0
192.168.1.0/24     *[Direct/0] 00:15:30
                    > via ge-0/0/0.0
192.168.1.10/32    *[Local/0] 00:15:30
                      Local via ge-0/0/0.0
0.0.0.0/0          *[Static/5] 00:10:12
                    > to 192.168.1.1 via ge-0/0/0.0$$::text, $$[{"id": "A", "text": "192.168.1.1", "is_correct": true}, {"id": "B", "text": "10.0.0.1", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "C", "text": "192.168.1.10", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "D", "text": "0.0.0.0", "is_correct": false}]$$::jsonb, $$The 10.0.0.0/24 static route points to next-hop 192.168.1.1.$$::text, $${"https://www.juniper.net/us/en/training/certification/certification-tracks/jncia-junos.html"}$$::text[], $$5.0 Routing Fundamentals$$::text, 16.67, '13be57164cc2fe38', true) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
-- +goose StatementEnd

